# Headless-test scratch modules. The text-surgery harnesses in tools/ write a
# patched copy of a real module NEXT TO IT (relative imports have to resolve),
# import it, then unlink it. A crashed run leaves one behind, and four were
# committed by accident in 7c0a65b — a frozen fork of modularRoadScenery.js
# that sat in the root for a month. The PID keeps parallel runs from colliding.
.*.[0-9]*.mjs
